docs {
  # Delete Document
  
  Delete a document from both the database and Cloudinary storage.
  
  **Authentication Required:** Admin JWT token
  
  ## URL Parameters
  - `id` (string): MongoDB ObjectId of the document to delete
  
  ## Success Response (204)
  No content returned on successful deletion.
  
  ## Error Response (404)
  ```json
  {
    "status": "fail",
    "message": "Document not found"
  }
  ```
}